	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Christus, servator unicus, velit <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>hunc annum et tibi et tuis esse felicissimum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Gratias ago pro scriptis; schedam re<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mitto, ut iubebas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis d. legatum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et precaberis ipsi felicissimum annum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dudum audivi <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>graves fuisse concertationes inter cardinales <placeName ref="l1060">Mantuanum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et <placeName ref="l1291">Turnonium</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">So hör ich wol: der <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>drittman mit der däschen ist darzwüschen <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>gekummen und fürt die brut heym.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Der <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Tüffel zerryß imm die däschen und den stuͦl; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>das ist min glückwünschen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Reliquit ei gran<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dem pecuniam frater mortuus, marchio <persName>Müssiae</persName>, per <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quam nunc potuit mercari sedem pestilentiae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Quoniam vero multi ei invident, mox tolletur <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>veneno.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Aber aller tüffel namen: sy sind <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>doch bessers nitt wärt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><placeName ref="l646">Claronensis</placeName> co<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ntroversia adhuc ita haeret: legati <placeName ref="l2448">5 Pagorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>responderunt se nihil accepisse in mandatis, velle <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>autem ea, quae proposuerint illi, referre domum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>efficereque, si possint, ut proximis comitiis 4. <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>februarii <placeName ref="l21">Badae</placeName> celebrandis respondeatur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Reliquae <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Cantones serio mandarunt, ne quid interim vi <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>aut manu armata tentent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">So ist's noch im kunst:</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Dominus orandus est sedulo, ut frangat cruenta <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>et impia impiorum consilia.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Veneti forte foedus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ambient; audio enim ipsos sibi a <persName>Philippo</persName> me<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tuere et a <persName>Sabaudo</persName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">De literis tuis, ne ali<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>quando tibi accersant periculum, iubeo te esse <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>securum; si posthac ullas aboleri volueris, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>subsigna ad finem: "Crema."</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Wers dann les<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>e, wurd meinen, der brieff wer geschriben <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>von <placeName ref="l104">Cremona</placeName> etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Sed quod modo dixi, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>nolo te esse solicitum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Der guͦt, fromm schuld<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>heyß <persName>Weyß</persName> ist uns der tagen ouch gestorben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Vive et vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Festinavi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 5. <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ianuarii 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><foreign xml:lang="la">Mei omnes te <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>et tuos salutant</foreign> und wünschend üch ein guͦt jar.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tu<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>us<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ministro fideli, domino et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>fratri charissimo suo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
